sequenceDiagram
    participant Author
    participant Claude as Interviewing Claude
    participant Diff as Diff + inventory.yaml + ADRs
    participant Intent as intent.problem / intent.approach
    participant Unknowns as intent.unknowns

    Claude->>Diff: Read diff, districts, ADRs, stack card
    Claude->>Claude: Draft hypothesis from the diff (kept private)

    Claude->>Author: Ask "what problem does this solve?" (blind)
    Author-->>Claude: "assessment placement, Level 2 vs Level 3 of the viewer"
    Claude->>Author: Ask "what was your approach?" (blind)
    Author-->>Claude: "same viewer-placement account"

    Claude->>Claude: Compare both answers against the diff-derived hypothesis
    Note over Claude: Hypothesis says: rewrite_manifest() dedup + STE clarity pass.\nNeither author answer leads to the other.

    alt Same understanding, different altitude
        Claude->>Intent: Write reconciled problem/approach
    else Material mismatch survives re-check against diff
        Claude->>Diff: Re-read diff before raising it (hypothesis may be wrong, not the author)
        Claude->>Author: "I noticed your answers describe viewer-placement work,\nbut the diff shows a manifest dedup and a doc pass - resolve now or log it?"
        alt Author resolves now
            Author-->>Claude: Reconciled problem/approach
            Claude->>Intent: Write reconciled problem/approach
        else Author chooses to log it
            Claude->>Unknowns: Record mismatch in the author's own words
        end
    end
